//! The `flex` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)
//! [shorthand](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Cascade/Shorthand_properties)
//! property sets how a `flex item` will grow or shrink to fit the space available in its flex
//! container.
//!
//! Initial: flex-grow: 0; flex-shrink: 1; flex-basis: auto. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: none | [ <'flex-grow'> <'flex-shrink'>? || <'flex-basis'> ]
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-flexbox-2/#propdef-flex
//!
//! Author guide: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/flex
//!
//! Purpose and value descriptions adapted from MDN contributors (CC-BY-SA-2.5).
//!
//! Additional value descriptions: Microsoft (MIT).
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

